{"seq":2,"slug":"vectorized-operations","title":"向量化运算与函数式编程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/r-language-data-analysis/fundamentals/vectorized-operations","wordCount":1432,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"向量化运算与函数式编程\">向量化运算与函数式编程</h1><p>R 解释器执行一次循环迭代的开销约为 C 级向量操作的 100-500 倍。这不是实现缺陷，而是动态类型检查、环境查找、以及 copy-on-modify 语义的必然代价。向量化运算将循环下沉到 C/Fortran 层，让 R 用户在高层写声明式代码的同时获得接近编译语言的性能。函数式编程范式则提供了替代 for 循环的组合工具——将「对集合中每个元素做操作」表达为高阶函数调用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>向量化 = 把循环下沉到编译层</strong>：一次函数调用处理整个向量，解释器开销只付出一次。</li>\n<li><strong>性能差距来自解释器开销</strong>：R 层每次迭代要做变量查找、类型检查、分派与边界检查，向量化把这些成本分摊到整个向量上。</li>\n<li><strong>apply 家族是向量化的泛化</strong>：把&quot;对子集反复应用函数&quot;抽象为统一接口，按输入结构选择 lapply/apply/tapply/mapply。</li>\n<li><strong>函数是一等对象</strong>：可以赋值、传参、返回，闭包由此捕获定义环境，成为工厂模式的基础。</li>\n<li><strong>管道让组合从左到右可读</strong>：原生 <code>|&gt;</code> 追求零额外开销，magrittr <code>%&gt;%</code> 保留占位符能力。</li>\n<li><strong>并非所有操作都能向量化</strong>：递推关系、带副作用的条件分支、需要提前终止的搜索仍需显式迭代。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"向量化的本质\">向量化的本质</h2><p>向量化（vectorization）指一次函数调用处理整个向量，内部循环由编译后的 C/Fortran 代码执行：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"# 向量化：C 层循环&#10;x &lt;- runif(1e6)&#10;y &lt;- sqrt(x)  # 一次调用处理 100 万个元素&#10;&#10;# 非向量化：R 层循环&#10;y2 &lt;- numeric(1e6)&#10;for (i in seq_along(x)) {&#10;  y2[i] &lt;- sqrt(x[i])&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 向量化：C 层循环</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>x &#x3C;- runif(1e6)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>y &#x3C;- sqrt(x)  # 一次调用处理 100 万个元素</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 非向量化：R 层循环</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>y2 &#x3C;- numeric(1e6)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>for (i in seq_along(x)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  y2[i] &#x3C;- sqrt(x[i])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>性能差异的根源在于解释器开销。R 层每次迭代需要：变量查找 → 类型检查 → 分派 → 赋值 → 边界检查。向量化操作将这些开销分摊到整个向量上，只付出一次。</p>\n<h3 id=\"常用向量化运算\">常用向量化运算</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类别</th>\n<th>函数</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>算术</td>\n<td><code>+</code>, <code>-</code>, <code>*</code>, <code>/</code>, <code>^</code>, <code>%%</code></td>\n<td>逐元素运算，支持循环补齐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>比较</td>\n<td><code>&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;</code>, <code>==</code>, <code>!=</code>, <code>&gt;=</code>, <code>&lt;=</code></td>\n<td>返回逻辑向量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>逻辑</td>\n<td><code>&amp;</code>, <code>|</code>, <code>!</code>, <code>xor()</code></td>\n<td>逐元素布尔运算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数学</td>\n<td><code>sqrt()</code>, <code>log()</code>, <code>exp()</code>, <code>abs()</code></td>\n<td>元素级数学函数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>汇总</td>\n<td><code>sum()</code>, <code>mean()</code>, <code>max()</code>, <code>min()</code></td>\n<td>向量 → 标量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>累积</td>\n<td><code>cumsum()</code>, <code>cumprod()</code>, <code>cummax()</code></td>\n<td>保持向量长度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>字符</td>\n<td><code>paste0()</code>, <code>nchar()</code>, <code>substr()</code></td>\n<td>向量化字符操作</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"循环补齐-recycling\">循环补齐（Recycling）</h3><p>当两个向量长度不一致时，短向量被循环重复至与长向量等长：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"x &lt;- 1:6&#10;y &lt;- c(10, 20)&#10;x + y  # [1] 11 22 13 24 15 26&#10;# y 被补齐为 c(10, 20, 10, 20, 10, 20)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>x &#x3C;- 1:6</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>y &#x3C;- c(10, 20)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>x + y  # [1] 11 22 13 24 15 26</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># y 被补齐为 c(10, 20, 10, 20, 10, 20)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>循环补齐是 R 的核心设计——标量运算 <code>x + 1</code> 本质是长度 1 向量与长度 n 向量的补齐。但当长度不整除时只给出警告而非错误，这是常见 bug 来源。</p>\n<h2 id=\"apply-家族-向量化的泛化\">Apply 家族：向量化的泛化</h2><p><code>apply</code> 家族将「对数据子集反复应用函数」的模式抽象化：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[输入数据] --&gt; B{apply 家族}&#10;    B --&gt;|&quot;向量/列表&quot;| C[sapply / vapply / lapply]&#10;    B --&gt;|&quot;矩阵行/列&quot;| D[apply]&#10;    B --&gt;|&quot;分组数据框&quot;| E[tapply / by]&#10;    B --&gt;|&quot;多参数并行&quot;| F[mapply / Map]&#10;    C --&gt; G[输出]&#10;    D --&gt; G&#10;    E --&gt; G&#10;    F --&gt; G\">graph LR\n    A[输入数据] --&gt; B{apply 家族}\n    B --&gt;|\"向量/列表\"| C[sapply / vapply / lapply]\n    B --&gt;|\"矩阵行/列\"| D[apply]\n    B --&gt;|\"分组数据框\"| E[tapply / by]\n    B --&gt;|\"多参数并行\"| F[mapply / Map]\n    C --&gt; G[输出]\n    D --&gt; G\n    E --&gt; G\n    F --&gt; G</pre><h3 id=\"lapply-与-sapply\"><code>lapply</code> 与 <code>sapply</code></h3><p><code>lapply</code> 对列表每个元素应用函数，返回列表；<code>sapply</code> 尝试简化结果为向量或矩阵：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"data_list &lt;- list(a = 1:10, b = 11:20, c = 21:30)&#10;&#10;# lapply 返回列表&#10;lapply(data_list, mean)&#10;# $a [1] 5.5  $b [1] 15.5  $c [1] 25.5&#10;&#10;# sapply 简化为命名向量&#10;sapply(data_list, mean)&#10;# a     b     c&#10;# 5.5  15.5  25.5\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>data_list &#x3C;- list(a = 1:10, b = 11:20, c = 21:30)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># lapply 返回列表</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>lapply(data_list, mean)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># $a [1] 5.5  $b [1] 15.5  $c [1] 25.5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># sapply 简化为命名向量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>sapply(data_list, mean)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># a     b     c</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 5.5  15.5  25.5</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>vapply</code> 是更安全的选择——强制指定返回类型，避免意外的类型变化：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"vapply(data_list, mean, FUN.VALUE = numeric(1))\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>vapply(data_list, mean, FUN.VALUE = numeric(1))</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"apply-处理矩阵\"><code>apply</code> 处理矩阵</h3><p><code>apply(X, MARGIN, FUN)</code> 中 MARGIN=1 表示按行，MARGIN=2 表示按列：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"m &lt;- matrix(rnorm(1000), nrow = 100, ncol = 10)&#10;col_means &lt;- apply(m, 2, mean)    # 10 个列均值&#10;row_sds &lt;- apply(m, 1, sd)        # 100 个行标准差\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>m &#x3C;- matrix(rnorm(1000), nrow = 100, ncol = 10)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>col_means &#x3C;- apply(m, 2, mean)    # 10 个列均值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>row_sds &#x3C;- apply(m, 1, sd)        # 100 个行标准差</span></span></code></pre></div><p>注意：对矩阵列操作优先使用专用函数 <code>colMeans()</code>、<code>colSums()</code>、<code>rowMeans()</code>、<code>rowSums()</code>——它们是完全 C 实现的，比 <code>apply</code> 快 5-10 倍。</p>\n<h3 id=\"tapply-分组聚合\"><code>tapply</code> 分组聚合</h3><p><code>tapply(X, INDEX, FUN)</code> 按因子分组后对每组应用函数：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"scores &lt;- c(85, 92, 78, 96, 88, 73)&#10;groups &lt;- factor(c(&quot;A&quot;, &quot;B&quot;, &quot;A&quot;, &quot;B&quot;, &quot;A&quot;, &quot;B&quot;))&#10;tapply(scores, groups, mean)&#10;# A    B&#10;# 83.67 87.00\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>scores &#x3C;- c(85, 92, 78, 96, 88, 73)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>groups &#x3C;- factor(c(\"A\", \"B\", \"A\", \"B\", \"A\", \"B\"))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>tapply(scores, groups, mean)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># A    B</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 83.67 87.00</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"函数式编程基础\">函数式编程基础</h2><p>R 中函数是一等对象（first-class object）——可以赋值给变量、作为参数传递、从函数返回。这是函数式编程的基础。</p>\n<h3 id=\"匿名函数\">匿名函数</h3><p>R 4.1 引入了简洁的 lambda 语法 <code>\\(x)</code>，替代传统的 <code>function(x)</code>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"# 传统写法&#10;sapply(1:5, function(x) x^2)&#10;&#10;# R 4.1+ lambda 语法&#10;sapply(1:5, \\(x) x^2)&#10;&#10;# 多参数&#10;mapply(\\(x, y) x + y, 1:3, 4:6)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 传统写法</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>sapply(1:5, function(x) x^2)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># R 4.1+ lambda 语法</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>sapply(1:5, \\(x) x^2)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 多参数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>mapply(\\(x, y) x + y, 1:3, 4:6)</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"闭包-closure\">闭包（Closure）</h3><p>函数捕获其定义环境中的变量，形成闭包：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"make_power &lt;- function(exp) {&#10;  function(x) x^exp  # exp 从外层环境捕获&#10;}&#10;&#10;square &lt;- make_power(2)&#10;cube &lt;- make_power(3)&#10;square(5)  # 25&#10;cube(5)    # 125\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>make_power &#x3C;- function(exp) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  function(x) x^exp  # exp 从外层环境捕获</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>square &#x3C;- make_power(2)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>cube &#x3C;- make_power(3)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>square(5)  # 25</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>cube(5)    # 125</span></span></code></pre></div><p>闭包是工厂模式的基础——生成配置化的函数族。</p>\n<h3 id=\"函数组合与管道\">函数组合与管道</h3><p>R 4.1 引入的原生管道 <code>|&gt;</code> 让函数组合读起来从左到右：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"# 无管道：嵌套调用，从内向外读&#10;result &lt;- round(mean(abs(diff(sort(x)))), 2)&#10;&#10;# 有管道：线性流，从左到右读&#10;result &lt;- x |&gt;&#10;  sort() |&gt;&#10;  diff() |&gt;&#10;  abs() |&gt;&#10;  mean() |&gt;&#10;  round(2)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 无管道：嵌套调用，从内向外读</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>result &#x3C;- round(mean(abs(diff(sort(x)))), 2)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 有管道：线性流，从左到右读</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>result &#x3C;- x |></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  sort() |></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  diff() |></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  abs() |></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  mean() |></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  round(2)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>原生管道 <code>|&gt;</code> 与 magrittr 管道 <code>%&gt;%</code> 的关键区别：<code>|&gt;</code> 要求右侧是函数调用（不支持 <code>.</code> 占位符），性能更好（无额外函数调用开销）。需要占位符时使用 lambda：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"mtcars |&gt; (\\(d) lm(mpg ~ wt, data = d))()\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>mtcars |> (\\(d) lm(mpg ~ wt, data = d))()</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"reduce-与函数式工具\">Reduce 与函数式工具</h2><p><code>Reduce()</code> 将二元函数依次应用于列表，产生累积结果：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"# 列表中多个数据框按行合并&#10;dfs &lt;- list(df1, df2, df3, df4)&#10;combined &lt;- Reduce(rbind, dfs)&#10;&#10;# 累积求交集&#10;sets &lt;- list(c(1,2,3,4), c(2,3,4,5), c(3,4,5,6))&#10;Reduce(intersect, sets)  # [1] 3 4\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 列表中多个数据框按行合并</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>dfs &#x3C;- list(df1, df2, df3, df4)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>combined &#x3C;- Reduce(rbind, dfs)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 累积求交集</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>sets &#x3C;- list(c(1,2,3,4), c(2,3,4,5), c(3,4,5,6))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Reduce(intersect, sets)  # [1] 3 4</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>Filter()</code>、<code>Find()</code>、<code>Position()</code> 提供列表的函数式操作：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"nums &lt;- list(1, &quot;a&quot;, 2, &quot;b&quot;, 3)&#10;Filter(is.numeric, nums)  # list(1, 2, 3)&#10;Find(is.character, nums)  # &quot;a&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>nums &#x3C;- list(1, \"a\", 2, \"b\", 3)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Filter(is.numeric, nums)  # list(1, 2, 3)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Find(is.character, nums)  # \"a\"</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"向量化的陷阱与解决策略\">向量化的陷阱与解决策略</h2><h3 id=\"非向量化场景\">非向量化场景</h3><p>不是所有操作都能向量化。以下场景需要显式迭代：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>递推关系：当前值依赖前一个值（如 ARIMA 模拟）</li>\n<li>条件分支内有副作用（写文件、发请求）</li>\n<li>需要提前终止（找到第一个满足条件的元素）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>对于递推关系，如果性能关键，应考虑用 Rcpp 写 C++ 循环——参见<a href=\"../applications/r-performance-scaling\">R 性能优化与大数据</a>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"ifelse-vs-if-else\"><code>ifelse()</code> vs <code>if...else</code></h3><p><code>ifelse()</code> 是向量化的条件选择；<code>if...else</code> 只处理标量条件：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"x &lt;- c(-2, 0, 3, -1, 5)&#10;&#10;# 向量化条件&#10;ifelse(x &gt; 0, x, 0)  # [1] 0 0 3 0 5&#10;&#10;# dplyr::case_when 更适合多条件&#10;dplyr::case_when(&#10;  x &gt; 0  ~ &quot;positive&quot;,&#10;  x == 0 ~ &quot;zero&quot;,&#10;  x &lt; 0  ~ &quot;negative&quot;&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>x &#x3C;- c(-2, 0, 3, -1, 5)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 向量化条件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>ifelse(x > 0, x, 0)  # [1] 0 0 3 0 5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># dplyr::case_when 更适合多条件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>dplyr::case_when(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  x > 0  ~ \"positive\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  x == 0 ~ \"zero\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  x &#x3C; 0  ~ \"negative\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"预分配-vs-增长\">预分配 vs 增长</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"# 错误：每次迭代复制整个向量 — O(n^2)&#10;result &lt;- c()&#10;for (i in 1:1e5) result &lt;- c(result, i^2)&#10;&#10;# 正确：预分配后填充 — O(n)&#10;result &lt;- numeric(1e5)&#10;for (i in 1:1e5) result[i] &lt;- i^2&#10;&#10;# 最佳：向量化 — O(n) 且常数更小&#10;result &lt;- (1:1e5)^2\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 错误：每次迭代复制整个向量 — O(n^2)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>result &#x3C;- c()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>for (i in 1:1e5) result &#x3C;- c(result, i^2)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 正确：预分配后填充 — O(n)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>result &#x3C;- numeric(1e5)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>for (i in 1:1e5) result[i] &#x3C;- i^2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 最佳：向量化 — O(n) 且常数更小</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>result &#x3C;- (1:1e5)^2</span></span></code></pre></div><p>从<a href=\"r-data-types-structures\">R 数据类型与结构</a>中的 copy-on-modify 语义可以理解为何增长向量代价高昂：每次 <code>c(result, new)</code> 都触发完整复制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"实战模式-批量文件处理\">实战模式：批量文件处理</h2><p>结合函数式编程与向量化的典型场景——批量读取 CSV 并合并：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"csv_files &lt;- list.files(&quot;data/&quot;, pattern = &quot;\\\\.csv$&quot;, full.names = TRUE)&#10;&#10;# 函数式方式：lapply + Reduce&#10;all_data &lt;- csv_files |&gt;&#10;  lapply(read.csv) |&gt;&#10;  Reduce(f = rbind)&#10;&#10;# 等价的 purrr 方式（见 tidyr-purrr-pipeline 章节）&#10;# all_data &lt;- purrr::map(csv_files, readr::read_csv) |&gt; purrr::list_rbind()\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>csv_files &#x3C;- list.files(\"data/\", pattern = \"\\\\.csv$\", full.names = TRUE)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 函数式方式：lapply + Reduce</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>all_data &#x3C;- csv_files |></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  lapply(read.csv) |></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Reduce(f = rbind)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 等价的 purrr 方式（见 tidyr-purrr-pipeline 章节）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># all_data &#x3C;- purrr::map(csv_files, readr::read_csv) |> purrr::list_rbind()</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这比 for 循环更简洁，且 <code>lapply</code> 内部有优化——但如果文件很大，真正的性能瓶颈在 I/O 而非循环开销。实际生产中应使用 <code>data.table::fread()</code> 或 Arrow 后端——详见<a href=\"../applications/r-performance-scaling\">R 性能优化与大数据</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>向量化把循环下沉到 C/Fortran 层，是 R 中最重要的性能手段——先向量化，再考虑其他优化。</li>\n<li>apply 家族按输入结构分工：向量/列表用 sapply/lapply，矩阵用 apply，分组用 tapply，多参数用 mapply。</li>\n<li><code>vapply</code> 通过 <code>FUN.VALUE</code> 强制返回类型，比 <code>sapply</code> 更安全；矩阵行列汇总优先用 <code>colMeans()</code> 等专用函数。</li>\n<li>函数是一等对象，闭包与原生管道 <code>|&gt;</code> 提供了组合工具，让 for 循环可以被声明式表达替代。</li>\n<li>循环补齐是 R 的核心设计，但长度不整除时只警告不报错，是常见 bug 来源。</li>\n<li>无法向量化的递推场景应预分配后填充，性能关键时下沉到 Rcpp。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"向量化运算与函数式编程","id":"向量化运算与函数式编程"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"向量化的本质","id":"向量化的本质"},{"level":3,"text":"常用向量化运算","id":"常用向量化运算"},{"level":3,"text":"循环补齐（Recycling）","id":"循环补齐-recycling"},{"level":2,"text":"Apply 家族：向量化的泛化","id":"apply-家族-向量化的泛化"},{"level":3,"text":"`lapply` 与 `sapply`","id":"lapply-与-sapply"},{"level":3,"text":"`apply` 处理矩阵","id":"apply-处理矩阵"},{"level":3,"text":"`tapply` 分组聚合","id":"tapply-分组聚合"},{"level":2,"text":"函数式编程基础","id":"函数式编程基础"},{"level":3,"text":"匿名函数","id":"匿名函数"},{"level":3,"text":"闭包（Closure）","id":"闭包-closure"},{"level":3,"text":"函数组合与管道","id":"函数组合与管道"},{"level":2,"text":"Reduce 与函数式工具","id":"reduce-与函数式工具"},{"level":2,"text":"向量化的陷阱与解决策略","id":"向量化的陷阱与解决策略"},{"level":3,"text":"非向量化场景","id":"非向量化场景"},{"level":3,"text":"`ifelse()` vs `if...else`","id":"ifelse-vs-if-else"},{"level":3,"text":"预分配 vs 增长","id":"预分配-vs-增长"},{"level":2,"text":"实战模式：批量文件处理","id":"实战模式-批量文件处理"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"R 数据类型与结构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/r-language-data-analysis/fundamentals/r-data-types-structures"},"next":{"title":"R 包生态与开发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/r-language-data-analysis/fundamentals/r-package-ecosystem"}}